{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2023-02-07 08:01:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS BRINGS INNOVATIVE SECURITY TECHNOLOGY TO FRANKFURT AIRPORT', 'text': "RESTON, VA. , FEB. 7, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEIDOS\xa0(NYSE:LDOS), A FORTUNE® 500 SCIENCE AND TECHNOLOGY LEADER,\xa0ANNOUNCED THE DEPLOYMENT OF ITS CLEARSCAN™ COMPUTED TOMOGRAPHY (CT) SCANNER AT GERMANY'S FRANKFURT AIRPORT (FRA)."}